COMMERCIAL LEASE
THIS LEASE made and entered into this 15thdayof January,2025, by and between the
Coldwell Banker—TPE Inc., hereinafter called"Lessor,"and F&G Corporation Inc., a
Wyoming corporation, hereinafter called"Lessee."
WITNESSETH:
WHEREAS, Lessor owns the real property and buildings located at 255 Storey Blvd,
Cheyenne, WY82009which may here in after be called the"Property."
WHEREAS, Lessor desires to lease the Premises known an individual office in the
Property on the terms and conditions here in after set forth.
NOW, THEREFORE, it is mutually agreed between theparties hereto asfollows:
1.DEMISE AND TERM: Lessor hereby leases to Lessee, and Lessee hereby rents
shall consist of--200 square foot office in thebuilding and associated parking located at 255
Storey Blvd, Cheyenne, WY82009.
2.RENTAND SECURITY DEPOSIT: Lessee shall pay the following rent schedule
starting on January 1,2025:
Monthly Rent:$250.00/month
hereof beginning with the monthof January1,2025.Anypayment received more than10 days
after the due dates hall haveadded thereto a late payment penalty equal to10%of thepayment.
Lessee shall notbe obligated topaya damage and security deposit.
3.QUIET ENJOYMENT: Lessor warrants that it is the owner of the Premises and
has full right and authority to enterinto this Lease.Lessor covenants that, forand during the
term of this Lease, it will not cause or allow anything tobe done whichwill impair Lessee's
leasehold interest and rights hereunder.Lessor shall defend the Lessee in the enjoyment and
peaceful possession of the premises during allterms of this lease.
4.UTILITIES AND OTHER EXPENSES: Lessor shall be responsible for all
carrying costsfor theproperty which shall include: outside maintenance, landscaping of the
grounds, owrmoval, janitorial sr vices, water, lctricity, as and sanitation.naditin,
Lessor shall pay thereal estate taxes, and standard property insurance associated with the
Property.Lessee shallbe exclusively responsible for business insurance, personal property tax,
indoor maintenance, windows, internet and telephone of theleased Premises.
5.REPAIRAND MAINTENANCE: Lessor shall, at its expense, keep andmaintain
the Premises inaclean, neat, sanitary order and in good condition andrepair during the
occupancy of Lessee.Lessee shall not cause or permit any waste or nuisance in or about the
Premises.Lessee is responsible for all routine repairs otherthan normal wear and tear, including
broken glass, damage to interior walls, doors and fixtures.Any major repairs shall be primarily
the responsibility of the Lessor.
6.ACCESS: Lessor, and its duly authorized agents, afternotice to Lessee, shall have
access to the Premises at all reasonable timesfor the purpose of inspecting the same and tomake
